  "details": "This is a weird issue, and I am not sure how to reproduce it.\n\nIn the world \"Astral Bounds\" there are kites https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_34693736-118a-4a1f-9b4d-95b866ed83a7.\n\nWhen I dropped a kite, I noticed that the \"Use/Drop\" buttons didn't disappeared, and remained on the screen even if I grabbed the kite again.\n\nHere's a very short video. After I dropped the kite in the last second of the video, notice how the \"Use/Drop\" buttons didn't disappeared from the screen. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h73E_Fx0xQM\n\n\"Enable auto hold\" was turned off, but I am unsure if it is related.",
